      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks that helps. so if i'm looking at how we got to the way things are right now—like the specific scientific method or modern democratic systems—would i mostly be looking at the European influence? it feels like all the stuff you mentioned from the east was more like ancient history, whereas the stuff that actually led to the modern world comes from the west. is that a fair way to frame it for my paper?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
